{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Then I said.</b> This is the occurrence that befalls all who come into the world, both good and evil. And the matter of \"why was I wise\" — in all that I engaged with in the affairs of the world in which I toiled and in which I acted wisely under the sun — and I spoke in my heart that this wisdom too is vanity."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:27:13.704228206Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}